      <description align="left" color="orange" colored="true" height="303" resized="true" width="599" x="28" y="139">You may find the demo video &lt;a href="https://academy.rapidminer.com/learn/video/trim-whitespace"&gt;here!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Use the trim operator on Vorname&lt;br&gt;2. Use the rename operator to change 'Vorname' to 'First Name'&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-- Optional: Perform the same task with Turbo Prep --&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Run the existing process and then in results, Open in Turbo Prep&lt;br&gt;2. Generate: Make a new column, 'First Name' without leading and trailing spaces from the Vorname column.&lt;br&gt;trim([Vorname])&lt;br&gt;Commit Transformation&lt;br&gt;3. Select Vorname and Transformations - Remove. Apply to remove the column, and commit.&lt;br&gt;4. Add to Process</description>
